        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "62fd8419-907b-5035-a388-12f69f1f4543",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Theodor Jensen\n- Bands: The Hives, Broder Daniel, The Plan\n- Albums: Barely Legal\n- Places: Sweden, Gothenburg, Fagersta\n- Topics: Swedish rock, alternative rock, garage rock revival\n\nFacts:\n- The Hives are a Swedish rock band from Fagersta, Sweden.\n- Broder Daniel was an alternative rock band from Gothenburg, Sweden.\n- In 2000, Theodor Jensen formed the Swedish band The Plan after serving as Broder Daniel's guitarist and later bass player.\n- In the early 2000s, The Hives rose to prominence during the garage rock revival.\n- Barely Legal is the debut studio album by the Swedish rock band The Hives.",
